{"product_id":"the-gluten-free-cookbook-for-kids-101-exciting-and-delicious-recipes","title":"The Gluten-Free Cookbook for Kids: 101 Exciting and Delicious Recipes","description":"\u003cp\u003eHaving to follow a gluten-free diet can be a daunting prospect for children and young adults‰ÛÓthey feel isolated at a time when their friends are enjoying everything from bread, pizza, and pasta, to crisps, cakes, and biscuits. Yet with supermarkets now stocking many gluten-free ingredients, you can make versatile, healthy, and enticing gluten-free meals that will appeal to all the family. Based on recipes created for the author's own daughter, The Gluten-free Cookbook for Kids includes over 100 recipes‰ÛÓfrom crispy chicken nuggets and quick pizza to birthday cupcakes and peanut butter cookies‰ÛÓa list of store cupboard essentials, creative ideas for special treats, healthy snacks, top tips for eating out, and more. The Gluten-free Cookbook for Kids will solve many of your mealtime dilemmas and help your child to learn what they can and can't eat. An essential guide for any gluten-free family.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Adriana Rabinovich\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780091923891\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45204297810073,"sku":"7RF9780091923891","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67cb18c9532e5_The_20Gluten-Free_20Cookbook_20for_20Kids-_20101_20Exciting_20and_20Delicious_20Recipes_20Adriana_20Rabinovich.jpg?v=1741538036","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-gluten-free-cookbook-for-kids-101-exciting-and-delicious-recipes","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}